# play status --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's main menu, its header, risk level and$
# status rows read by the real checks, header probe and risk$
# level from a simulated host, hostfake's host.System, whose$
# commands a model of the host answers. Its items lead to the$
# screen mocks, which show Figma's host, not this one, on the$
# gallery's fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes.$
$
# Status hosts #################################################$
$
  Select a host$
$
   1) Debian 13$
      ssh.service, ufw allowing 22$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04$
      ssh.socket, unattended-upgrades$
   3) Alpine 3.24$
      OpenRC, doas, no ufw$
   4) Proxmox VE 9$
      A node as installed$
   5) Fresh Debian 13$
      Root alone, nothing set up$
   6) Ubuntu 26.04 cloud image$
      ufw inactive, key-only$
   7) Ubuntu 26.04 from the ISO$
      ufw inactive, passwords$
   8) Hardened Debian 13$
      Every row as hardn wants it$
   9) Figma's host$
      00-TUI-MAIN's rows$
  10) Lockout$
      ufw refuses SSH$
  11) Lockout at ufw's start$
      ufw stopped, its rules refuse SSH$
  12) Reboot pending$
      A newer kernel, Ubuntu 26.04$
  13) AppArmor logging only$
      Every profile in complain mode$
  14) AppArmor off after restart$
      apparmor.service disabled$
  15) AppArmor off in kernel$
      apparmor=0$
  16) AppArmor unread$
      securityfs not mounted$
  17) Container$
      Debian 13 in LXC$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-17 or q]: 9$
$
